# Admin Actions Logs Directory
# 
# This directory stores audit logs of admin actions.
# 
# Each entry includes:
# - Admin user ID and email
# - Action type (CREATE, UPDATE, DELETE, etc.)
# - Target entity type and ID
# - Old values (before change)
# - New values (after change)
# - Timestamp
# - IP address of admin
# 
# Retention: 2 years (security requirement)
# Access: Restricted to compliance and security teams
# Purpose: Forensics, audit trails, compliance reporting
# 
# DO NOT modify or delete for the retention period.
